<title>UK: Seino Transport sets 20 bln yen convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Seino Transport sets 20 bln yen convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seino Transportation has launched a 20 billion yen convertible bond due March 31, 2004, lead manager Daiwa said.</p>
<p>The deal will be priced at par with a coupon indicated at between 0.125 and 0.375 percent.</p>
<p>Final terms will be set on December 17. Fees total 2.5 points. Payment is due December 27.</p>
